      "writtenOn": "2022-12-14T13:49:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, that\u0027s right.\nThrowing wouldn\u0027t really help clients? We don\u0027t let you set 0 explicitly, because it\u0027s pointless, but it\u0027s reasonable to enquire about a VM\u0027s config.",
